Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.35,0:04:50.88,Title,0,0,0,0,,《悬崖上的金鱼姬》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，要快点回来喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.51,0:06:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,金鱼耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.12,0:08:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.97,0:09:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奇怪喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是死掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她舔我耶！她还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.87,0:09:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，该出门啰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.67,0:09:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.47,0:09:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有金鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.22,0:09:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奇怪的风喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.89,0:09:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，我先去热车了啰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.63,0:10:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了没有？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么，她被人类抓走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.61,0:10:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了，这下糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.61,0:10:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像死掉了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还活着！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.19,0:11:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.20,0:11:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快迟到了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎，金鱼还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.77,0:11:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,金鱼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在海边捡到的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我不知道你是哪位
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.93,0:11:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要在这里撒农药好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，其实这并不是农药
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.31,0:11:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是怕太乾燥了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.84,0:11:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喷洒的是深海里的净水
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.61,0:11:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是农药的话就好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.68,0:11:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉唷！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.09,0:12:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕，越来越不妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一个好奇怪的人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.33,0:12:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不能说他是个怪人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为不能以貌取人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.10,0:12:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会，我才不会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.57,0:12:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，你要把她带到幼稚园去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.87,0:12:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,老师会答应吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,老师会答应的，我会保护你放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛮可爱的嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.58,0:12:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,吭！今天船会到港
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.55,0:12:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,到学校前，把早餐吃完
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道，她吃不吃这个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.13,0:12:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.90,0:12:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦！伤口不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.17,0:12:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎！我想要叫她波妞喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:12:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:12:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,像水波一样软
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.21,0:13:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且又会用魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,被波妞舔过以后伤口就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃火腿吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.21,0:13:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎！波妞喜欢吃火腿耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我蛮像的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎太太，快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.85,0:14:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真脏呀，有够脏的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,加藤先生，早
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.36,0:14:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，看得到我们家喔，你看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.91,0:14:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,早！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.44,0:14:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安！要玩什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.45,0:14:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，停在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.06,0:14:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.89,0:14:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:14:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去上课啰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.26,0:15:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,早，对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,纪子婆婆的轮椅就麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.06,0:15:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.66,0:15:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安呀小宗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,芳江婆婆，我现在很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下再聊喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉唷唷唷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.59,0:15:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,辰婆婆，等一下再聊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.22,0:15:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉呀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,老师会不会不准啊…想到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这边等我喔，我马上就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会有猫啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,要乖乖待在这里喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.53,0:16:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就会回来看你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！小敏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.21,0:16:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然有点发烧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过没事的，放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.41,0:16:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就拜托你了，拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.55,0:16:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,老师，早安
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安小宗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.68,0:16:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宗你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.29,0:16:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！久美子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.69,0:16:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看，漂亮吗？我妈妈买给我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.06,0:16:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，我们去玩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.13,0:16:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在很忙不要啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你在这里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟你说我很忙嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介真怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.60,0:16:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪，哼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.65,0:17:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.29,0:17:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.07,0:17:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.84,0:17:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.24,0:17:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以随便带东西来学校耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个又不是幼稚园的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.81,0:17:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是向日葵之家的所以可以
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.11,0:17:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，是金鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.15,0:17:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是金鱼呢，她是波妞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.75,0:17:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞？我想看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你看的话，不可以告诉别人喔？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.49,0:17:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，我不说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.86,0:17:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看，她是不是很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.00,0:17:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪怪的，那么胖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.54,0:17:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家的金鱼比较可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.11,0:18:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.98,0:18:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.21,0:18:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜哇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是久美子自己不好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁叫她要说波妞的坏话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.34,0:18:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来，我帮你加水喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.38,0:18:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.80,0:18:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.93,0:19:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵呵，太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.91,0:19:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.38,0:19:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.35,0:19:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么好像听到小宗的声音呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.62,0:19:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过小宗这时候应该在上课才对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.05,0:19:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我耳朵不中用了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.42,0:19:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,芳江婆婆，你没有听错啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.13,0:19:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉呀唉呀，小宗在这呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜看，桶子里有东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.37,0:19:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜对了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,再猜猜，是什么颜色的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.51,0:19:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯，红色？-红色
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.68,0:19:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,答对了，你们怎么会知道呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看-让我看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉呀真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.19,0:19:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可爱喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:19:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫做波妞，喜欢吃火腿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.43,0:20:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还会魔法喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.00,0:20:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边的伤口被波妞舔过以后
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.63,0:20:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看就好啰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.37,0:20:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯-这样呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道能不能也舔舔我们的腿呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.01,0:20:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是能再像小宗那样奔跑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,该有多好啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，那得问问看波妞能不能做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿过来也让我看一看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀，辰婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.02,0:20:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉呀讨厌，这不是人面鱼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.59,0:20:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快把它放回海里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.83,0:20:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然会招来海啸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.86,0:20:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么海啸啊！你也太夸张了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.03,0:20:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说人面鱼一上岸就会有海啸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.67,0:20:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不相信我说的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.70,0:20:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,海啸啊，海啸来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.31,0:20:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,海啸来了啊！海啸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:20:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了，辰婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.79,0:21:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,衣服都弄湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.57,0:21:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.91,0:21:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，快点过来跟辰婆婆道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.99,0:21:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心啦！波妞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会保护你的，放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.80,0:21:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.54,0:21:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.27,0:21:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.95,0:22:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，我是宗介
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.91,0:22:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞喜欢宗介
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.66,0:22:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也喜欢你！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.66,0:22:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞喜欢宗介
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.30,0:22:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘻嘻嘻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.94,0:22:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.71,0:23:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，波妞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.38,0:23:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.25,0:23:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，波妞，波妞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.95,0:23:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞-宗介！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.92,0:23:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，波妞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.52,0:23:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.03,0:23:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，波妞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.76,0:23:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜哇
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.38,0:24:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.85,0:24:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有他的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.69,0:24:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算难过也没办法改变命运
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.89,0:24:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞的命运是要在海里生活
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.19,0:24:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以必须回到那里去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.69,0:24:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过，那个洒农药的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.10,0:24:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的是蛮诡异的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.37,0:24:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我吃一口
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.50,0:24:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看，都滴下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.34,0:24:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好吃嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.75,0:24:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,来，打起精神来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.55,0:24:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘啦，今天耕一要回来喔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.18,0:24:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介要是没精神的话他会失望的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.51,0:25:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,听话，今天不要再去海边喔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.45,0:25:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看了快进屋子里来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.58,0:25:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,把水桶放在这里的话
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.38,0:25:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞再来就会知道这是我们家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.49,0:26:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也对，如果你想放的话，那就放吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.12,0:26:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.74,0:26:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，你先接一下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.64,0:26:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是耕一打的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.34,0:26:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂，你找谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.01,0:26:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，我是宗介
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.48,0:26:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，很好呀
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.68,0:26:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天，没有办法回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.55,0:26:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会通过港口拜托你打信号啰
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.19,0:26:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…我把电话给理莎听
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.92,0:26:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,耕一…嗯…什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.89,0:26:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会跟他们说不行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.16,0:26:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么可以就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.00,0:26:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把老婆小孩丢在山上不管呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.87,0:26:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼！不理你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.24,0:26:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.07,0:26:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，我们今天到外面吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.18,0:26:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在家里吃耶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.81,0:27:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是耕一！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.14,0:27:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎，是耕一的船！快点关灯
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.53,0:27:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是宗介！真是个小天才
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.17,0:27:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才五岁耶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.97,0:28:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老婆在生气吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.18,0:28:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对°不°起
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.88,0:28:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎，他跟你说对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.18,0:28:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,B.A.K.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.89,0:28:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,B.A.K.A…（笨蛋）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.96,0:28:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎，他说他爱你！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.17,0:28:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说很爱很爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.31,0:28:36.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（笨蛋 笨蛋 笨蛋 笨蛋…）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.12,0:28:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇…好漂亮喔-哼
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.66,0:28:53.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一路顺风）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.69,0:28:58.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（谢谢）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.57,0:29:01.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（晚安）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.15,0:29:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎，不要哭啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.29,0:29:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会哭的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.19,0:29:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来答应波妞说要保护她的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.67,0:29:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，她没有在哭吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.27,0:29:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.97,0:29:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我要打起精神来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.24,0:29:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打起精神来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.31,0:29:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好痛喔
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.38,0:29:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也要打起精神
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.82,0:29:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞一定也跟理莎一样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.59,0:29:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.59,0:29:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.26,0:29:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，吃饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.73,0:30:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,连耕一的份也一起吃光
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.74,0:30:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会这么蠢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.54,0:30:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,早知道这样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.64,0:30:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本就不应该带你们
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.91,0:30:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,来参观农场的工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.78,0:30:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的水跟空气是多么地肮脏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.38,0:30:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说过很多次吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.62,0:30:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,来，快吃了这个，快
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.35,0:30:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗？布伦希尔蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.39,0:30:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要火腿
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.46,0:30:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,…火，火腿！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.23,0:30:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪里知道这种可怕的东西的？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.56,0:30:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说，布伦希尔蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.50,0:30:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不叫布伦希尔蒂，我叫波妞
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.30,0:30:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,波…波…波妞？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.11,0:30:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，喜欢宗介
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.71,0:30:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，要变成人类
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.24,0:30:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成人类？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.75,0:30:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种愚蠢又可憎的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.65,0:30:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.45,0:30:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类只会从大海夺走生命罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.95,0:31:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,想当初我也曾经是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.92,0:31:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了放弃当人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.56,0:31:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我花了多少…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.76,0:31:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞想要手
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.40,0:31:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞也不要这样的脚
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.73,0:31:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要有像宗介一样的脚
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.90,0:31:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.27,0:31:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.38,0:31:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.15,0:31:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜呜…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.59,0:31:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,长出手了！长出脚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.66,0:31:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,长出来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.43,0:31:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.33,0:31:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你舔了人类的血液
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.23,0:31:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,布伦希尔蒂？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.46,0:31:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要去找宗介
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.23,0:31:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！在你体内的劣等基因
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.40,0:31:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,受到了污染而苏醒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.07,0:31:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快变回去，快变回去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.24,0:31:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快变回去，快变回去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.71,0:31:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.48,0:31:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,变回去，变回去，变回去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.71,0:32:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去，回去，回去…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.85,0:32:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.39,0:32:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！力量好像不够！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.12,0:32:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.32,0:32:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去！嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.79,0:32:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去！出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.66,0:32:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去！出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.33,0:32:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.57,0:32:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶的血啊，沉静下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.67,0:32:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,再小，再小，再小，再小…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.65,0:32:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉！真不愧是那个人的孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.52,0:32:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.93,0:32:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你能一直都纯真无邪就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.15,0:33:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我的能力只能够镇住一时
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.39,0:33:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法还是得叫她来了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.20,0:33:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，那能量对你们来说太强了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.30,0:33:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘，嘘，不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.74,0:33:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是好险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.04,0:33:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻挡螃蟹的结界变脆弱
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.07,0:33:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点让生态界要失衡了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.44,0:33:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静，冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.81,0:33:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉唷！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.45,0:33:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一想到要见她就让我紧张了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.98,0:33:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.55,0:33:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，这个提炼好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.96,0:33:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个没有松开吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.50,0:34:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…这门开关不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.41,0:34:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下得要修了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.75,0:34:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,连一只海蟑螂跑进去都是件大事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.44,0:34:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.11,0:34:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在海洋能量正完全
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.25,0:34:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,渗透进基因之中
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.05,0:34:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当这口井注满的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.02,0:34:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋的时代会再度来临
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.65,0:34:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命的爆发将可以匹敌寒武纪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.72,0:35:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可憎的人类时代就要结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.80,0:35:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这门真不好关
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.25,0:36:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.83,0:36:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去找宗介！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.38,0:39:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙捲风！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.35,0:39:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长，你看，你看那个
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.12,0:39:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是海啸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.39,0:39:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,把船乘在浪上面！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.16,0:39:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.63,0:39:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长，无线电和雷达都不管用了！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.07,0:39:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,欸，有个女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.37,0:39:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来跟宗介差不多大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.62,0:39:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.75,0:39:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.22,0:39:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢老师
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.49,0:39:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里，不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.36,0:40:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宗要不要在这里等一下？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.30,0:40:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,老师陪你走过去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.53,0:40:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系，我走捷径过去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.57,0:40:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,老师明天见啰
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.27,0:40:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天见！小心一点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.98,0:40:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，宗介，对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.01,0:40:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为停电了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.12,0:40:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动门打不开对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.08,0:41:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 幼稚园那边还好吗？-嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.15,0:41:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎太太，没关系，你可以先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.52,0:41:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,金子太太还没来耶？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.36,0:41:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系啦，只是晚一点而已
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.96,0:41:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我们今天晚上都要留下来过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.83,0:41:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你趁回得去的时候，快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.57,0:41:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，等我一下下喔
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.84,0:41:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.55,0:41:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,芳江婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.58,0:41:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉呀是小宗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.42,0:41:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑漆漆的看不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.59,0:41:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,芳江婆婆，这个给你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.43,0:41:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉唷，是什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.13,0:41:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,纪子婆婆也给你一个
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.13,0:41:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你呀
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.17,0:41:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,太黑了什么都看不见
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.54,0:41:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这么点风雨就停电
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.51,0:41:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才不想在这里过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.71,0:42:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,电来了，太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.78,0:42:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好亮呀，是金鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.92,0:42:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是因为小宗来了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.99,0:42:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以电就跟着来了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.42,0:42:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然形成的轻度台风
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.06,0:42:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,带来了强劲的风势
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.62,0:42:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外还夹杂着暴雨…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.59,0:42:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,请沿海附近的船只…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.29,0:42:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是台烂电视，都看不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.90,0:42:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,连气象也乱报一通
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.90,0:42:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就不准嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.37,0:42:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宗，快回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.84,0:42:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了你的金鱼护身符
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.11,0:42:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就什么都不怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.74,0:42:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.18,0:42:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也给辰婆婆一个
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.76,0:42:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,皱巴巴的，这是什么东西啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.36,0:42:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.96,0:42:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了，是蚱蜢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.00,0:42:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是啦，是小金井丸号
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.53,0:42:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是小宗爸爸的船对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.37,0:42:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.24,0:43:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是看起来像蚱蜢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.84,0:43:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，我们要走啰
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.84,0:43:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快跟辰婆婆她们说再见
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.21,0:43:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，再见了，明天再见
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.48,0:43:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天再见
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.95,0:43:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心不要被风吹走啰
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.39,0:43:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来，从这边上车
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.40,0:43:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真糟糕，电话也打不通
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.49,0:43:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎，海浪涨起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.36,0:43:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,船会不会沉下去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.00,0:43:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果出外海的话，船就不怕风浪了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.10,0:44:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,耕一一定出外海了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.21,0:44:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有鱼耶，理莎，你看有鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.55,0:44:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下系好安全带！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.76,0:44:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎太太，这边已经过不去了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.80,0:44:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚已经发布避难命令了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.30,0:44:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,吭！避难命令？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.80,0:44:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是婆婆她们
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.83,0:44:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,都还留在向日葵之家！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.37,0:44:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎么办呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.60,0:44:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是岛的另一边，堤防又高
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.04,0:44:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.94,0:44:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之我非得先回家一趟不可
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.94,0:44:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边不能过啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.21,0:44:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你绕山路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.72,0:44:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，要冲了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.95,0:44:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.92,0:44:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.49,0:44:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,大浪要来啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.66,0:45:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,浪来啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.93,0:45:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃啊，理莎太太
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.07,0:45:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些鱼跟过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.77,0:45:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,系好安全带，宗介！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.09,0:46:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐好，要加速啰
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.91,0:46:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是缠人的海浪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.22,0:47:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个女孩掉下去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.69,0:47:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.32,0:47:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚她在鱼的上面！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.10,0:47:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.44,0:47:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,水位越来越高了，宗介
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.84,0:47:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里看到那个小女孩的？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.71,0:47:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才她在那边，鱼的上面跑
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.48,0:47:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在鱼上面跑？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.25,0:47:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.72,0:47:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.64,0:48:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑着点宗介，我们马上就要到家了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.50,0:48:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个小女孩！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.96,0:49:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险啊，快点过来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.13,0:49:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介你待在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.61,0:49:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.66,0:49:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，你认识她吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.25,0:49:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.35,0:49:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯！我是波妞！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.82,0:49:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是波妞？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.09,0:50:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.06,0:50:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞变成一个小女生回来了耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.13,0:50:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.37,0:50:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到宗介了！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.66,0:50:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好喔，宗介还有波妞
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.80,0:50:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你们觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.97,0:50:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多么不可思议，有多么兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.67,0:50:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,都先冷静下来，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.80,0:50:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.94,0:50:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.88,0:50:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，你先把雨衣脱下来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.58,0:50:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞没有穿鞋子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.25,0:50:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个你拿一下
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.85,0:51:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖唷！我去拿东西来给你们擦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.17,0:51:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，这边
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.74,0:51:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有宗介的味道！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.78,0:51:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.62,0:51:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.92,0:51:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.76,0:51:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能这样子湿答答的乱跑喔
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.20,0:51:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞有一头很漂亮的红发呢，咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.30,0:51:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的衣服没有湿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.34,0:51:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为波妞本来就是鱼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.74,0:51:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,湿了也没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.61,0:51:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.11,0:52:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞喜欢这个
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.18,0:52:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，那么我们来喝茶吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.68,0:52:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，照明就麻烦你啰
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.12,0:52:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.85,0:52:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们说，现在会不会有水呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.32,0:52:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有水
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.29,0:52:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有水！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.69,0:52:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好耶！-好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.16,0:52:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在山坡上面有水槽的关系啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.07,0:52:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有瓦斯呢，点燃！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.97,0:52:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.87,0:52:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.97,0:52:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为是天然瓦斯
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.81,0:52:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，请过去坐下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.28,0:52:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.48,0:52:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，是这边啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.06,0:52:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,要像这样坐喔
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.76,0:52:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把东西放下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.03,0:52:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就不能用手了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.07,0:52:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有脚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.34,0:53:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.91,0:53:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦，你们在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.28,0:53:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞的脚，可以像手一样耶
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.53,0:53:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,请用
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.40,0:53:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.34,0:53:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要开动啰
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.23,0:54:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼 真好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.03,0:54:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那，接下来我们要干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.27,0:54:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞想要吃火腿
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.10,0:54:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞最喜欢吃火腿了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.84,0:54:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊，那我们吃饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.11,0:54:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过吃饭前，得先去发动发电机呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.34,0:54:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为要有电才有办法连络耕一
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.58,0:54:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了告诉你，耕一是我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.42,0:54:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是坏魔法师吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.09,0:54:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.42,0:54:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是小金井丸号的船长
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.16,0:55:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞的爸爸在做什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.76,0:55:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫藤本，他都把我关起来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.73,0:55:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,吭！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.56,0:55:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞是逃出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.77,0:55:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.23,0:55:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那波妞的妈妈呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.34,0:55:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞最喜欢妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.94,0:55:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜 她超级可怕的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.41,0:55:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟理莎一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.61,0:55:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.87,0:55:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，拜托你啰
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.72,0:55:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕，可能油管堵住了发不动
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.03,0:55:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,堵住了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.46,0:55:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,堵住了，是那边堵住了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.91,0:55:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.25,0:56:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.65,0:56:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好亮喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.19,0:56:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.01,0:56:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,天线，天线
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.87,0:56:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.81,0:56:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家是不是都沉下去了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.35,0:56:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,连一点灯光都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.40,0:56:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吵
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.27,0:56:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,连不上吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.57,0:57:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀，讯号好像没办法连上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.24,0:57:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边是JA一4LLJA-4LL
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.88,0:57:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,耕一听得到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.78,0:57:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是理莎，宗介还有波妞
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.48,0:57:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一切都很好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.29,0:57:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等一下要吃饭啰
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.09,0:57:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,火腿
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.27,0:57:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,放进去了吗？小心点很烫喔
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.52,0:57:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,泡一下才能吃
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.35,0:57:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,要等3分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.04,0:58:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,请把眼睛闭起来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.74,0:58:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.68,0:58:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，闭起来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.08,0:58:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，可以吃啰，把盖子打开 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.02,0:58:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.69,0:58:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有火腿
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.83,0:58:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.80,0:58:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好烫，好烫
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.62,0:58:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎，波妞睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.96,0:59:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞从很远的地方来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.46,0:59:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想，应该是
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.05,0:59:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介你快来看，海浪平静下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.85,0:59:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为波妞睡着了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.75,0:59:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，你看那边
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.16,0:59:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有光在动，好像有人在那个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.26,0:59:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是芳江婆婆她们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.67,0:59:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.07,0:59:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是山上的路
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.45,0:59:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，你陪在波妞身边
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.73,1:00:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在绕山路的话
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.26,1:00:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许可以到的了向日葵之家
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.63,1:00:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，我得要过去看一下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.24,1:00:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要去！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.64,1:00:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，你跟波妞待在家里
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.04,1:00:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要去啦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.41,1:00:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带波妞一起去就好啦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.91,1:00:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要跟你走
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.72,1:00:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.55,1:00:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这个家就像暴风雨中的灯塔
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.59,1:00:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗中的人们都依靠着这个光芒
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.19,1:00:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为他们指引方向
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.86,1:00:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以一定要有人留着
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.59,1:00:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然发生了很多无法理解的事
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.16,1:00:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前也没有办法知道答案
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.70,1:00:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是很快就会了解的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.70,1:00:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我比较担心养老院的人
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.77,1:00:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你帮我守着这个家的话
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.04,1:00:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会变得更有力量
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.11,1:01:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介你放心好了，我一定会回来的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.41,1:01:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.05,1:01:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.52,1:01:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能骗人喔
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.88,1:01:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢宗介了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.51,1:02:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,月亮出来了，看到村子的灯火了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.01,1:02:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.21,1:02:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就能确定方位了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.25,1:02:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没到过的村子耶
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.29,1:02:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.22,1:02:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是不是漂到美国了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.88,1:02:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是山，那也不是个港口
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.61,1:02:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部都是船！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.16,1:02:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些船被海水冲积
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.49,1:02:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,堆成一座山了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.96,1:03:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一定是船的坟场
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.96,1:03:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,通往冥界的门开了！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.24,1:03:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,引擎停了！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.61,1:03:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,让船停在海面上！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.07,1:03:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,新井，快把锚放下去！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.61,1:03:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.19,1:03:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面是什么东西啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.70,1:03:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.45,1:03:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到观世音菩萨了！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.30,1:04:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以动了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.50,1:04:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.37,1:04:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！是菩萨
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.94,1:04:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是观世音菩萨帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.94,1:04:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,南无阿弥陀佛，南无阿弥陀佛
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.61,1:04:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,南无阿弥陀佛，南无阿弥陀佛
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.74,1:04:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,高一点，高一点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.84,1:04:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.78,1:05:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然还在周围设了结界
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.52,1:05:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她到底是从哪里学会这些的！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.61,1:05:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.61,1:05:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事呀！竟然还变成了人类
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.88,1:05:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇，危险
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.34,1:05:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！你们在干什么呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.35,1:05:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！哇！哇！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.59,1:05:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们！啊，危险
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.93,1:05:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,住，住手啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.60,1:05:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！你们这些小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.34,1:05:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸是为了姐姐着想呀…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.88,1:06:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！是她！她，她来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.92,1:06:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,藤本
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.29,1:06:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了，你终于来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.26,1:06:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好美的海
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.00,1:06:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满了魔力
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.66,1:06:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像回到了泥盆纪的大海一样
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.37,1:07:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，她喝了人类的血
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.64,1:07:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还把我存下来的生命之水全用光了！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.91,1:07:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，嗯！这个名字蛮好听的！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.91,1:07:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.35,1:07:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.69,1:07:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞随便乱用魔力
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.89,1:07:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在世界开了个大洞
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.32,1:07:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她根本不知道自己正在做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.43,1:07:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还变成人类
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.56,1:07:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,私自跑到人类的男朋友家里去
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.43,1:07:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样放任她的话，世界会毁灭啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.50,1:07:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.84,1:07:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.61,1:07:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,连人造卫星都开始坠落了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.55,1:07:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,行星重力场崩坏的第二个阶段
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.15,1:07:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.79,1:07:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静点
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.79,1:08:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，那男孩叫宗介呀
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.10,1:08:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些小家伙最喜欢姐姐是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.51,1:08:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,老公，我们就让波妞变成人类吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.81,1:08:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.81,1:08:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那古老的魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.85,1:08:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要那个叫宗介的不变心
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.38,1:08:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞就会失去魔力变成人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.95,1:08:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，那个方法…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.99,1:08:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是失败，波妞就会变成泡沫
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.93,1:08:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,原本我们也是从泡沫诞生的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.73,1:08:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他才五岁耶，不行啦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.96,1:08:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.80,1:08:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就安静地睡吧，小朋友们
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.45,1:09:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介！宗介
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.96,1:09:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！好痛喔
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.76,1:09:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，早安
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.77,1:09:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.80,1:09:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.04,1:09:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.21,1:09:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕，陆地变成海洋了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.23,1:09:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎不在家耶
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.23,1:09:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为路被淹掉啦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.60,1:09:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，要是有船就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.41,1:09:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边有船呀
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.08,1:09:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是又不能坐
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.65,1:10:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以啦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.45,1:10:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.96,1:10:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 变大了！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.30,1:10:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇，连蜡烛都一起变大了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.31,1:10:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以坐了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.61,1:10:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯！好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.31,1:10:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.64,1:10:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我搬那边
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.81,1:10:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.61,1:10:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.02,1:10:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.05,1:10:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！喔 喔 喔 喔 喔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.06,1:10:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.36,1:10:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,浮起来了！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.73,1:10:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.37,1:10:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,船里面也没有渗水进来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.90,1:10:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了，要让管子进水才行
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.97,1:10:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让水进去这里
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.88,1:11:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,再进去这个圆圆的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.07,1:11:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.74,1:11:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像火箭
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.92,1:11:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.62,1:11:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.65,1:11:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.82,1:11:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好°棒
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.02,1:11:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.89,1:11:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒…好棒…好棒…好棒…好棒…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.51,1:12:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,会烫吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.98,1:12:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好烫
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.45,1:12:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好烫！-好烫！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.79,1:12:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇，点起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.93,1:12:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,点起来了！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.60,1:12:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好烫，好烫，好烫，好烫
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.41,1:12:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好烫喔
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.27,1:12:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.22,1:12:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,会动了 嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.52,1:12:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，你好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.12,1:12:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯-真的好棒
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.89,1:12:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.60,1:13:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.63,1:13:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，好开心喔
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.00,1:13:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.10,1:13:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，蜡烛在烧耶
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.07,1:13:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.21,1:13:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，很烫吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.91,1:13:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞你负责看守前面
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.05,1:13:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在后面负责掌舵
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.28,1:13:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，波妞看守
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.94,1:13:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,底下有路耶
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.68,1:13:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是理莎走过的山路
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.22,1:13:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是理莎不在
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.18,1:13:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定会在
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.49,1:13:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为理莎答应过我了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.39,1:14:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是古代鱼
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.59,1:14:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是泥盆纪的海洋生物耶
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.83,1:14:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，那是沟鳞鱼啦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.94,1:14:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条是什么鱼？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.44,1:14:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,泥盆世肺鱼！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.54,1:14:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,泥盆世肺鱼！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.37,1:14:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇，好大喔
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.84,1:14:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是帝波鲶克斯啦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.65,1:14:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝波鲶克斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.35,1:14:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.69,1:14:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.26,1:14:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.89,1:14:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边有船！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.63,1:14:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.73,1:14:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在叫我们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.70,1:14:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.44,1:14:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好烫
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.01,1:14:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈，咦？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.01,1:14:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.88,1:14:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道要怎么弄了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.78,1:15:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，可以吹啰
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.49,1:15:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,噗！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.69,1:15:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.09,1:15:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.13,1:15:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇，真是一艘好船呀
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.63,1:15:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是谁呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.70,1:15:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是理莎太太的儿子小宗呀
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.13,1:15:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是小宗啦，是宗介啦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.84,1:15:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫波妞
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.34,1:15:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞本来是一条鱼喔
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.91,1:15:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条鱼？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.08,1:15:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞真是个好名字呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.45,1:15:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.25,1:15:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,叔叔，你有看到理莎吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.55,1:15:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎太太？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.55,1:15:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没有在一起吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.32,1:15:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去向日葵之家了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.02,1:15:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,向日葵之家啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.49,1:15:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是小宝宝喔
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.66,1:16:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖，乖
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.36,1:16:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.53,1:16:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个要给我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.28,1:16:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖，借我一下喔
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.69,1:16:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.29,1:16:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就不客气啰
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.59,1:16:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇，好好喝的汤喔！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.26,1:16:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是理莎煮的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.53,1:16:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要给小宝宝喝的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.33,1:17:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！啊，对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.77,1:17:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宝宝太小还不能够喝汤
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.54,1:17:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果我喝了这个汤
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.74,1:17:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以有奶喂小宝宝啰
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.18,1:17:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.14,1:17:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是喝理莎的奶奶长大的喔
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.15,1:17:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.92,1:17:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我可以喝掉这个汤了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.38,1:17:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，可以啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.95,1:17:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.06,1:17:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿咻！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.96,1:17:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿咻！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.36,1:17:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿咻！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.53,1:17:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿咻！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.61,1:17:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是村子里的人，像船的祭典一样
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.61,1:17:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂，你们那边有没有什么
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.05,1:17:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要我们帮忙的啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.28,1:17:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们，目前没问题我们很好
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.95,1:17:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那请你们跟在船队后面
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.49,1:17:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,往山上的旅馆移动好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.66,1:18:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我们知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.13,1:18:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多人喔
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.80,1:18:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了，大家都没事
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.40,1:18:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，要点火啰
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.87,1:18:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们先等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.27,1:18:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看喔
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.61,1:18:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有喔
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.65,1:18:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.05,1:18:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.32,1:18:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面的火腿都被波妞吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.15,1:18:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.19,1:18:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会有好多奶奶的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.12,1:18:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个给你，虽然是用剩的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.39,1:18:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你收着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.13,1:18:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，波妞会把它变大的，谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.76,1:18:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点喔
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.76,1:18:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们喔
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.74,1:18:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 怎么了呀
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.48,1:18:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖乖，呃 乖
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.20,1:19:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.23,1:19:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.78,1:19:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.61,1:19:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.58,1:19:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宗呀-真厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.05,1:19:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好帅喔
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.15,1:19:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎太太呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.39,1:19:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎太太怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.85,1:19:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去向日葵之家了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.69,1:19:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正要过去接她
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.72,1:19:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那理莎太太，一定撑过那些大浪了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.49,1:19:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为她被浪吞掉了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.79,1:19:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，也让我坐一下好不好
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.26,1:19:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美子，我现在很忙
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.23,1:19:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次再说
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.47,1:19:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,向日葵之家的人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.90,1:19:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在前山公园避难啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.17,1:19:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑着点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.14,1:19:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.81,1:19:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等这边忙完
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.94,1:19:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也会到向日葵之家帮忙的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.78,1:19:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们一路顺利
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.86,1:20:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，差不多要换蜡烛了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.53,1:20:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题的，我有刚刚拿到的蜡烛
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.57,1:21:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好烫，还好烫喔
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.55,1:21:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.95,1:21:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞-嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.59,1:21:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个可以变大吗？-好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.56,1:21:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，想睡觉啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.74,1:21:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞-嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.82,1:21:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，波妞
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.45,1:22:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了，脚碰得到地了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.14,1:23:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面有路了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.39,1:23:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.76,1:23:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！船变小了！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.29,1:23:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.58,1:23:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，波妞
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.52,1:23:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.29,1:24:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.10,1:24:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.66,1:24:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为波妞要变回金鱼了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.05,1:24:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是理莎的车！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.51,1:24:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，理莎的车在那边！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.59,1:24:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎！理莎！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.89,1:24:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.53,1:24:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.76,1:24:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.67,1:24:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.64,1:24:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.14,1:24:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.78,1:24:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.48,1:25:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.65,1:25:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，你的船
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.15,1:25:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有水从你眼睛跑出来
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.96,1:25:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找理莎吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.89,1:25:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.14,1:26:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.07,1:26:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.14,1:26:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，我盖脚的毛巾
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.64,1:26:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.88,1:26:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快看，是鲸鱼先生
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.08,1:26:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真神气
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.88,1:26:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有魄力
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.05,1:26:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,极乐世界也是个不错的地方呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.88,1:26:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,膝盖也不会痛了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.12,1:26:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是极乐世界吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.55,1:26:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,难不成你以为这儿是龙宫城呀？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.16,1:26:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是浦岛少女呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.06,1:26:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位，请过来集合
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.53,1:26:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.23,1:26:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过去吧-走啰
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.97,1:27:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以奔跑真好
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.67,1:27:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先走一步啦
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.47,1:27:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真狡猾
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.51,1:27:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.38,1:27:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呀！佳代婆婆跑真快呀
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.08,1:27:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位，请安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.52,1:27:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定命运的时刻终于要来临了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.35,1:27:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介和波妞正朝着这里来呢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.99,1:27:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉唷，怎么办呀
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.86,1:27:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱的试炼呀
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.13,1:27:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,心儿扑通扑通的跳呢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.89,1:27:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.33,1:27:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.06,1:27:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,请安静，各位
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.66,1:27:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这项神圣试炼的见证人
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.60,1:27:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以还请各位稍安勿躁
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.00,1:27:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,藤本先生，你该不会
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.94,1:27:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,打算对他们做一些不好的事情吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.01,1:27:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.68,1:27:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对呀
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.48,1:27:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么可能呢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.65,1:27:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然不会
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.98,1:27:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要波妞能乖乖睡觉
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.25,1:27:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.16,1:28:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来他应该是个好人
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.56,1:28:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎太太在做什么呀？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.20,1:28:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看看那边
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.83,1:28:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一直在跟波妞的妈妈说话呢
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.08,1:28:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想理莎太太一定很难过
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.85,1:28:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道她们在说些什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.52,1:28:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们叫她看看，理莎太太
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.45,1:28:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎太太
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.09,1:28:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎太太，你放心
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.53,1:28:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是站在宗介和波妞那边的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.95,1:28:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎太太
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.02,1:28:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎太太
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.82,1:28:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很担心吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.98,1:28:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宗一定没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.59,1:28:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他很坚强啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.99,1:29:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个直率的好孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.86,1:29:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.99,1:29:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,请大家帮他们俩个加油
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.89,1:29:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.79,1:29:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么做吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.80,1:29:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然啦
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.14,1:29:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，那边有隧道
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.82,1:29:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前有走过这里
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.02,1:29:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.69,1:29:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这里
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.60,1:29:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以放开我的手喔
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.00,1:29:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.67,1:30:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.67,1:30:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.46,1:30:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.50,1:30:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.46,1:31:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，你不能死啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.16,1:31:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.60,1:31:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，醒过来，波妞
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.30,1:31:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘，不要叫醒她
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.87,1:31:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，你终于来了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.17,1:31:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎太太和老婆婆们
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.97,1:31:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都在等你喔
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.31,1:31:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎也在
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.54,1:31:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起来吧，宗介小弟弟
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.85,1:31:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,带波妞一起来
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.82,1:31:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让波妞好好的睡
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.72,1:31:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静的走吧，来
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.05,1:31:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.15,1:31:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.39,1:31:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你千万不要被那种人给骗了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.56,1:31:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽说些好听话
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.23,1:31:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把大家全都骗走了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.16,1:31:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,辰婆婆！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.36,1:31:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会上当的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.77,1:32:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快一点已经没有时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.30,1:32:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你看不见那个吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.37,1:32:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果月球再靠近的话
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.34,1:32:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没有办法挽回了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.27,1:32:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算说谎也要说得像样一点
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.44,1:32:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，已经…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.41,1:32:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，到我这儿来！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.38,1:32:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介小弟弟，一起走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.32,1:32:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你能拯救这个世界
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.55,1:32:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想动粗，啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.39,1:32:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.19,1:32:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！你居然这样对你亲生父亲！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.63,1:32:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.23,1:32:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介，快过来
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.84,1:32:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这样的！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.24,1:32:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！宗介
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.02,1:32:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快跳啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.02,1:33:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这是…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.05,1:34:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.95,1:34:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.21,1:34:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.62,1:34:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那边
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.02,1:34:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是哪里啊？！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.17,1:34:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定就是宗介吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.64,1:34:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，你好
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.27,1:34:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是波妞的妈妈吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.54,1:34:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，谢谢你把波妞带回来
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.61,1:34:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，谢谢你把波妞带回来
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.74,1:34:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.44,1:34:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.08,1:34:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.85,1:35:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介啊，波妞她为了要变成人类
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.65,1:35:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开了魔法之盖
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.75,1:35:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是要变成人
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.69,1:35:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要一个能接受
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.42,1:35:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真实的她的男孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.93,1:35:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.03,1:35:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞她本来是一条鱼吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.37,1:35:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.57,1:35:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞因为舔了你的血
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.77,1:35:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她成了半人鱼
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.47,1:35:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊，我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.54,1:35:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来波妞，是因为舔了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.17,1:35:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的血，才变成半人鱼的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.68,1:35:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是半人鱼
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.38,1:35:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都能接受波妞吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.48,1:35:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，不管，波妞她是鱼
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.85,1:35:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是半人鱼，还是人类都好
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.49,1:35:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全都喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.49,1:35:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.44,1:35:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，你过来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.12,1:36:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，宗介他愿意
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.16,1:36:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,当一个完全接受你的人
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.59,1:36:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要当人类就要舍弃所有魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.03,1:36:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.70,1:36:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.61,1:36:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到陆地以后请亲吻这个气泡
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.31,1:36:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞就会变成
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.58,1:36:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一样的五岁小女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.69,1:36:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.56,1:36:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你，波妞的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.20,1:37:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么现在，世界的裂缝要闭合了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.44,1:37:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀，宗介
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.24,1:37:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宗真了不起
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.24,1:37:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.34,1:37:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎太太
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.41,1:37:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.21,1:37:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.45,1:37:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈，太棒了，死而无憾啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.98,1:37:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,宗介
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.93,1:37:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,吭
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.11,1:37:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,理莎，谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.04,1:37:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也谢谢你！谢谢你，曼玛莲
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.42,1:37:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了，大家都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.53,1:38:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在去拿轮椅来
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.67,1:38:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用啦，我们自己可以走
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.00,1:38:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是热闹啊
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.61,1:38:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去你的船，还给你
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.61,1:38:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.21,1:38:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前种种很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.32,1:38:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以，握个手吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.86,1:38:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，就托付给你了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.39,1:38:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是耕一的船！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.47,1:38:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,耕一！喂！喂！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.14,1:38:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，是理莎，宗介也在
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.58,1:38:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！喂！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.88,1:38:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,波妞，那是耕一的船喔
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.45,1:38:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.54,1:39:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 波妞波妞波妞鱼的小宝贝 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.37,1:39:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 从深深蔚蓝色的大海洋而来 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.61,1:39:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 波妞波妞波妞胖嘟嘟起来 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.35,1:39:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 肚肚圆滚滚的小小女孩 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.73,1:39:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 跳一跳啊！踏一踏啊！∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.66,1:39:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有脚真好呦到处跑一跑 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.63,1:39:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 握一握手！挥一挥手！∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.57,1:39:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有手真好呦快来手牵手 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.84,1:39:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 和他一起跳一跳啊！∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.88,1:40:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我的胸口也一起跳舞 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.58,1:40:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哇酷哇酷亲亲 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.65,1:40:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哇酷哇酷抱抱 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.89,1:40:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我最喜欢的小男孩红通通呀 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.60,1:40:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 波妞波妞波妞鱼的小宝贝 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.40,1:40:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 从深深蔚蓝色的大海洋而来 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.60,1:40:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 波妞波妞波妞胖嘟嘟起来 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.44,1:40:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 肚肚圆滚滚的小小女孩 ∮
